{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"refresh"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"onSuccess"},{"kind":"text","text":": (["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?, "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@E@SPConfigurationState","text":"ConfigurationState"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"SnowplowTracker"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"refresh(onSuccess:)","externalID":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(cs)SPSnowplow(cm)refreshOnSuccess:"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow\/refresh(onSuccess:)"},"abstract":[{"text":"Reconfigure, create or delete the trackers based on the configuration downloaded remotely.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objc"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"refresh"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"onSuccess"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"@escaping"},{"kind":"text","text":" (["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?, "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ConfigurationState","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@E@SPConfigurationState","text":"ConfigurationState"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"onSuccess","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The callback called when a configuration (cached or downloaded) is set It passes the list of the namespaces associated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the created trackers."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The trackers configuration is automatically download from the endpoint indicated in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"RemoteConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"previously used to setup the trackers.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The method is asynchronous and you can receive the list of the created trackers in the callbacks once the trackers are created.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The downloaded configuration updates the cached one only if the configuration version is greater than the cached one.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Otherwise the cached one is kept and the callback is not called.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"IMPORTANT: The EventStore will persist all the events that have been tracked but not yet sent.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Those events are attached to the namespace.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If the tracker is removed or the app relaunched with a different namespace, those events can’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be sent to the collector and they remain in a zombie state inside the EventStore.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To remove all the zombie events you can call an internal method ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"removeUnsentEventsExceptForNamespaces"},{"text":" on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SPSQLEventStore"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which will delete all the EventStores instanced with namespaces not listed in the passed list.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/snowplow\/refresh(onsuccess:)"]}],"references":{"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker/Snowplow/refresh(onSuccess:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/snowplow\/refresh(onsuccess:)","title":"refresh(onSuccess:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"refresh"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"onSuccess"},{"kind":"text","text":": (["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?, "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@E@SPConfigurationState","text":"ConfigurationState"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconfigure, create or delete the trackers based on the configuration downloaded remotely."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow\/refresh(onSuccess:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SnowplowTracker/documentation/SnowplowTracker/Snowplow":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Snowplow","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Entry point to instance a new Snowplow tracker."}],"fragments":[{"text